Subject: [PATCH 01/50] qualcommax: ipq807x: scaffold EnGenius EWS377AP v3
 (ap-hk07) port

Add DTS, image recipe, and ipq-wifi package entry for the EnGenius
EWS377AP v3 (IPQ8072A), derived from the EAP660HD template as a starting
point for the Target C NSS-EDMA port. Hardware-specific values (GPIOs,
PHY/uplink, WiFi board data, install format) are marked TODO(extract)
pending OEM DTS + firmware extraction. See PORT-STATUS-ews377ap-v3.md.
